// Session timeline: every stretch of time a gateway spent in one phase.
//
// Source: the Phase column of IbGwMetrics_CL (one sample every 30 seconds), so a phase shorter
// than a sample interval can be missed and From/To are accurate to about 30 seconds. A gap
// between two rows of an instance (To of one row well before From of the next) means that no
// sample arrived in between: the state is NOT known there; it is not "logged-in".
// Use: paste into Log Analytics and pick the time range. Columns: Instance, BootId, Phase,
// From, To, Duration, Samples.
IbGwMetrics_CL
| where isnotempty(Phase)
| sort by Instance asc, TimeGenerated asc
| extend NewStretch = Instance != prev(Instance) or BootId != prev(BootId) or Phase != prev(Phase)
| extend Stretch = row_cumsum(toint(NewStretch))
| summarize From = min(TimeGenerated), To = max(TimeGenerated), Samples = count()
    by Instance, BootId, Phase, Stretch
| project Instance, BootId, Phase, From, To, Duration = To - From, Samples
| sort by Instance asc, From asc
